#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:210
msgid "Incremental test"
msgstr "增量测试"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:212
msgid ""
"In sbt 2.x, `test` task became an input task that accept arguments that can "
"filter the test suites to run:"
