"在 sbt 2.x 中，`test` 任务已成为接受可筛选要运行的测试套件的参数的输入任务："

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:218
msgid ""
"In addition, `test` is incremental and cached. This means, the test will not "
"run unless it previously failed or something changed since the last run."
msgstr ""
"此外，`test` 是增量且缓存的。这意味着，除非之前失败或自上次运行以来有所变更，"
