msgid "Client-side run"
msgstr "客户端运行"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:250
msgid ""
"In sbt 2.0, sbt server sends the `run` task back to sbtn, which will fork a "
"fresh JVM. All you have to do is:"
msgstr ""
"在 sbt 2.0 中，sbt server 将 `run` 任务发回 sbtn，后者将 fork 一个新的 JVM。"
"您只需执行："

