msgid ""
"This avoids blocking the sbt server, and you can have multiple runs. "
"Contributed by [@eed3si9n](https://github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#8060](https://"
"github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/8060). See also [run](../reference/sbt-run.md) "
